### Description

I am expecting that the thinking tokens will show up inside of the AIMessageChunk

### Environment / System Info

Python: 3.12
deepagents==0.5.3
langchain-openai==1.1.13

COMMENTS: I have observed that within libs/partners/openai/langchain_openai/chat_models/base.py, specifically in the _convert_delta_to_message_chunk() and _convert_dict_to_message() functions, there is no parsing for "reasoning_content" or "reasoning" (depending on the version of vLLM), leading to reasoning tokens being silently dropped.
I have implemented a fix to ensure these fields are correctly mapped and would like to submit it.
While specific integrations like ChatDeepSeek or ChatOpenRouter already handle these fields, the absence of a dedicated ChatVLLM implementation makes it impossible for vLLM users. But since the vLLM server is compatible with OpenAI, it makes more sense to update the existing ChatOpenAI.
